      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic 2 bed, 1 bath apartment to the rental market, located in the sought-after Carrig House development in the heart of Monkstown.\nThe apartment comes fully furnished and finished to a high standard throughout. It has a fully fitted kitchen opening onto a bright, open-plan living and dining area, along with two well-proportioned bedrooms, and a bathroom with both bath and shower. The apartment also benefits from a large private balcony and designated parking.\nIn terms of location, Carrig House sits on Carrickbrennan Road in the heart of Monkstown village, within easy walking distance of Monkstown Crescent's boutiques, delis and cafes, as well as SuperValu for everyday grocery needs. The area is also close to Blackrock and Dun Laoghaire, both offering further shopping, dining and seafront amenities.\nFor public transport, Salthill & Monkstown DART station is close by, roughly a 10 minute walk, with regular DART services running into Dublin city centre in approximately 20 minutes. By car and bus, Dublin city centre is roughly 2025 minutes away.\n1. Fully furnished and finished to a high standard\n2. Fully fitted kitchen\n3. Open-plan living/dining area\n4. 2 bedrooms\n5. Bathroom with both bath and shower\n6. Private balcony\n7. Designated parking\n8. Moments from Monkstown Crescent shops and SuperValu\n9. Salthill & Monkstown DART station 10 mins' walk away\n10. Dublin City Centre 20 mins' away\n11. Close to Blackrock and Dun Laoghaire\nENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY PLEASE."
      },
